  "notes": "USAGE:\nA godan verb ({五段動詞|ごだんどうし}) ending in -ru. Not to be confused with the ichidan verb ⟦{閉|し}める→閉める：00485_shimeru⟧ (to close) or ⟦{締|し}める→締める：10057_shimeru⟧ (to tighten). Often used in the ～て⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ form to describe a current damp state.\n\nThe transitive counterpart is {湿|しめ}らせる (to dampen, to moisten).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{空気|くうき}→空気：01390_kuuki⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{湿|しめ}る: the air gets humid\n- ⟦{布団|ふとん}→布団：01720_futon⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{湿|しめ}る: the futon gets damp\n- {湿|しめ}った⟦{空気|くうき}→空気：01390_kuuki⟧: damp air\n- {湿|しめ}った⟦{土|つち}→土：02229_tsuchi⟧: moist soil",
